+# Year-end rollover, by a steward only: generates the next fiscal year's twelve monthly periods exactly as
+# generate-fiscal-year does (each audited as PERIOD_ADDED), then adds each person's open figure at the end of the old
+# year's last period (the dues of their claims belonging to a period of the old year, OPEN or PENDING at that period's
+# end, counted as the period figures count them) to their carried figure for the new year's first period, each
+# audited as OPENING_SET, then records ROLLOVER fy=<old FY> periods=<made>. A year that is not four digits, a user who
+# is not a steward, or an old year with no periods is refused (400). Answers how many periods were made.
+archived:
+  class: net.officefloor.hq.app.sheet.CheckNotArchived
+  next: viewer
